# Common Mistakes

❌ My favourite colour are blue.

✅ My favourite colour **is** blue.

---

❌ I like blue because it is look beautiful.

✅ I like blue because it **looks** beautiful.

---

❌ Black colour is suit me.

✅ Black suits me well.

---

❌ Colour affect mood.

✅ Colours can affect our mood.

---

# Band 8+ Tip

Instead of only naming a colour, explain **why** you like it and **where** you use it.

### ❌ Basic

> I like black.

### ✅ Band 8+

> I particularly like black because it looks elegant and professional. Most of my clothes are black since it's easy to match with other colours and suitable for both casual and formal occasions.

